From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 01:28:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] service: leave the device's registration to signing in.

The service registered the device with Microsoft when it started, so every new Keychain service
added a device to the user's Microsoft account, even for an account that never signed in, and a
service that could not reach Microsoft did not start (status 69). At start it now only renews the
token of a registered device; signing in registers the device. Until then token requests get an
empty answer and license requests a failure. A token that could not be renewed is logged instead
of stopping the service.

Original work for macrock (GPL-3.0-only, as Xodus).

Topic: account
---
