 crates/xodus-service/src/main.rs           | 26 ++++++++---------
 crates/xodus-service/src/simple_context.rs |  4 +--
 crates/xodus/src/tokens/device.rs          | 34 +++++++++++++++++++---
 4 files changed, 57 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

